
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="theme-color" content="#fff0f5">
<title>Happy Birthday Lechu ♡</title>

<style>
:root {
  --pink: #f4a8bd;
  --deep: #a84d70;
  --cream: #fff8f5;
  --ink: #754c5b;
}
* { box-sizing: border-box; }
html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
body {
  margin: 0;
  background: var(--cream);
  color: var(--ink);
  font-family: Georgia, "Times New Roman", serif;
  text-align: center;
  overflow-x: hidden;
}
section { padding: 65px 20px; }
.hero {
  min-height: 100svh;
  display: flex;
  flex-direction: column;
  justify-content: center;
  align-items: center;
  background:
    radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 20%, #ffffff 0, transparent 35%),
    linear-gradient(145deg, #fff0f5, #fbd5e1, #fff6ed);
  position: relative;
  overflow: hidden;
}
.eyebrow {
  letter-spacing: 4px;
  text-transform: uppercase;
  font: 11px Arial, sans-serif;
}
h1 {
  font-size: clamp(42px, 12vw, 76px);
  line-height: 1.05;
  color: var(--deep);
  font-weight: normal;
  margin: 20px 0;
}
h2 { font-size: 32px; font-weight: normal; }
p { line-height: 1.85; }
.hero p { max-width: 310px; }
button, .button {
  display: inline-block;
  border: 0;
  background: var(--deep);
  color: white;
  padding: 14px 23px;
  border-radius: 30px;
  font-size: 14px;
  text-decoration: none;
  cursor: pointer;
  font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
  margin: 7px;
  transition: transform .2s;
}
button:active, .button:active { transform: scale(.96); }
.secondary {
  background: #fff;
  color: var(--deep);
  border: 1px solid #efc1d0;
}
.flower { font-size: 28px; margin: 10px; }
.wrap { max-width: 720px; margin: auto; }
.intro { font-size: 17px; }
.cake {
  font-size: 92px;
  margin: 18px 0;
  animation: bob 2.4s ease-in-out infinite;
}
@keyframes bob {
  0%,100% { transform: translateY(0); }
  50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
}
.gallery {
  display: grid;
  grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
  gap: 13px;
  margin-top: 25px;
}
.photo {
  background: white;
  padding: 9px 9px 18px;
  box-shadow: 0 5px 22px #aa65751c;
  transform: rotate(-2deg);
}
.photo:nth-child(even) { transform: rotate(2deg); }
.photo img {
  width: 100%;
  aspect-ratio: 3/4;
  object-fit: cover;
  background: #f9dce5;
  display: block;
}
.photo p { margin: 9px 0 0; font-size: 13px; }
.note {
  background: white;
  padding: 27px 23px;
  border: 1px solid #f2d3dd;
  border-radius: 20px;
  text-align: left;
  box-shadow: 0 8px 30px #a84d7010;
}
.note p { white-space: pre-line; }
.hidden { display: none; }
.final {
  background: linear-gradient(145deg, #fbd5e1, #fff1f5);
}
footer { padding: 25px 12px; font-size: 12px; }
.heart {
  position: fixed;
  bottom: -30px;
  pointer-events: none;
  z-index: 5;
  animation: rise 6s linear forwards;
}
@keyframes rise {
  to { transform: translateY(-110vh) rotate(35deg); opacity: 0; }
}
@media (min-width: 600px) {
  .gallery { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr)); }
}
</style>
</head>

<body>
<section class="hero" id="home">
  <div class="flower">🌷 ♡ 🌷</div>
  <div class="eyebrow">A little website, made just for you</div>
  <h1>Happy Birthday<br>Lechu ♡</h1>
  <p>
    To Sankara Lakshmi,<br>
    a beautiful soul who deserves a beautiful day.
  </p>
  <button onclick="document.getElementById('wish').scrollIntoView()">
    Open your little surprise ♡
  </button>
  <div class="flower">✿ &nbsp; ✧ &nbsp; ✿</div>
  <small>01 November 2026</small>
</section>

<section id="wish">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Today is all about you</div>
    <h2>It's your day, Lechu 🎂</h2>
    <div class="cake">🎂</div>
    <p class="intro">
      May your new year be filled with little joys,
      unexpected happiness, peaceful days, and
      all the beautiful things your heart hopes for.
    </p>
    <p>✨ Make a wish. You deserve the sweetest year. ✨</p>
    <button onclick="celebrate()">Send some birthday magic ✨</button>
    <p id="magic" aria-live="polite"></p>
  </div>
</section>

<section style="background:#fff0f5">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">Little moments, big memories</div>
    <h2>Our little corner ♡</h2>
    <p>Replace these sample pictures with your favourite memories together.</p>

    <div class="gallery">
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/400x520/f8dce6/96556e?text=Our+Memory+1"
             alt="Replace with your first favourite photo">
        <p>One of my favourite memories ♡</p>
      </div>
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/400x520/f5e5d9/96556e?text=Our+Memory+2"
             alt="Replace with your second favourite photo">
        <p>A moment worth keeping ✿</p>
      </div>
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/400x520/f5d9e4/96556e?text=Our+Memory+3"
             alt="Replace with your third favourite photo">
        <p>More memories to come ♡</p>
      </div>
      <div class="photo">
        <img src="https://placehold.co/400x520/f9e9e0/96556e?text=Our+Memory+4"
             alt="Replace with your fourth favourite photo">
        <p>A little piece of happiness 🌷</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="eyebrow">A few words from me</div>
    <h2>A little letter for you 💌</h2>
    <p>There's something here for you to read.</p>
    <button onclick="toggleLetter()" id="letterButton">
      Open your letter ♡
    </button>

    <div class="note hidden" id="letter">
      <p>Dear Lechu, 🌷

Happy Birthday!

I'm really glad that life gave me a friend like you.
Some people make ordinary days feel a little more special,
and I'm grateful for all the little moments we've shared.

On your birthday, I hope you always find reasons to smile,
people who genuinely care about you, courage for your dreams,
and peace even on the difficult days.

Never stop being the person you are.
Keep smiling, keep growing, and keep chasing everything
that makes you happy.

May 17 bring you countless beautiful memories,
new beginnings, and a heart full of contentment.

Thank you for being you.

Happy Birthday once again, Lechu! ♡

With lots of good wishes,
Your friend ✨</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="final">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="flower">🌸 ✨ 🌸</div>
    <h2>One last thing...</h2>
    <p>
      No matter how much life changes,
      I hope this year brings you closer to
      every dream you're quietly working towards.
    </p>
    <h2>Stay happy, Lechu ♡</h2>
    <button onclick="playTamilSong()">Play a Tamil song 🎵</button>
    <p style="font-size:12px">
      Tap the button to choose a song on YouTube.
    </p>
    <a class="button secondary" href="#home">Back to the beginning ↑</a>
  </div>
</section>

<footer>
  Made with ♡ especially for Lechu · 01.11.2026
</footer>

<script>
function toggleLetter() {
  const letter = document.getElementById("letter");
  const button = document.getElementById("letterButton");
  letter.classList.toggle("hidden");
  button.textContent = letter.classList.contains("hidden")
    ? "Open your letter ♡"
    : "Close your letter ♡";
}

function celebrate() {
  document.getElementById("magic").textContent =
    "💗 Happy Birthday, Lechu! 🌸 May your wishes bloom.";
  for (let i = 0; i < 24; i++) {
    setTimeout(() => {
      const heart = document.createElement("span");
      heart.className = "heart";
      heart.textContent = ["♡", "💗", "🌸", "✨"][i % 4];
      heart.style.left = Math.random() * 95 + "vw";
      heart.style.fontSize = (16 + Math.random() * 18) + "px";
      document.body.appendChild(heart);
      setTimeout(() => heart.remove(), 6200);
    }, i * 100);
  }
}

function playTamilSong() {
  window.open(
    "https://www.youtube.com/results?search_query=Tamil+birthday+special+melody+songs",
    "_blank",
    "noopener"
  );
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
